film om bæredygtig it","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383967","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Markets in carbon offsetting have, since their inception, been defended by their proponents as ‘experiments’ when it comes to the scale and the scope of their purpose of governing climate mitigation. Yet, different counter-narratives or ‘tales of defiance’ have been mounted as critiques of offsetting. This article focuses in particular on a tale of defiance, which continually has dismissed offsetting as a form of indulgence payment. While acknowledging that there are clear similarities between offsets and indulgence payments, the article argues that the indulgence payment metaphor glosses over the complexity of both types of transactions. The historical development of indulgence payments in the past demonstrates the difficulty of using them as simple models for understanding the problems inherent to offsetting, even if both types of transactions have been controversial. The debates over carbon offsetting continue to evolve, however, and recent developments seem to suggest a third tale, where the funding of emission-reducing projects are seen as donations of development aid, instead of being assumed to compensate for the donor’s emissions.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Dalsgaard, Steffen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382995"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Narrative","Payment","Value","carbon offsetting","indulgence"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tales of carbon offsets between experiments and indulgences","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/17530350.2021.1977675","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382995","identifier":[{"id":"85115258623","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-753bd2a5-84b2-4873-a1ac-4edfacf2c27b"],"keyword":["carbon offsetting","indulgence","narrative","payment","value"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2DFDBA124D905982EE95EC1D47853B35"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86249175/Tales_of_Carbon_Offsets_final_for_web.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/17530350.2021.1977675","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen","key":"dalsgaardpau","last":"Dalsgaard","locid":"bc7a60f7-45a0-401f-813f-6b4aa700c849","name":"Dalsgaard, Steffen","orcid":"0000-0003-3712-6988","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/17530350.2021.1977675","issn":["17530350","17530369"],"issn_org":["17530350"],"journal":"Journal of Cultural Economy","publisher":"Routledge","status":"p","title":"Journal of Cultural Economy"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85115258623"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-753bd2a5-84b2-4873-a1ac-4edfacf2c27b"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Tales of Carbon Offsets: Between Experiments and Indulgences?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382995","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
