{"abstract":"Studenterevalueringer er et misvisende værktøj til at vurdere, om undervisere på de videregående uddannelser er gode eller ej. En række undervisere fra Det Unge Akademi præsenterer her fem af de største problemer med evalueringerne","author_count":7,"contributors":["Dalsgaard, Peter","Bille, Mikkel","Bjørk, Rasmus","Dalsgaard, Steffen","Dimke, Henrik","Gram-Skjoldager, Karen","Zinner, Nikolaj Thomas"],"cuid":["S05-097.09-020447"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":"5+","level":"pop","mra":["hum","med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"undervisere her er de fem største problemer med studenterevalueringer","src":["au","dtu","itu","ruc","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/undervisere-her-er-de-fem-stoerste-problemer-med-studenterevalueringer?ref=newsletter&refid=25547&SNSubscribed=true&utm_source=nyhedsbrev&utm_medium=e-mail&utm_campaign=forskning","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S05-097.09-020447","ids":["au-6ad58991-c089-4a1a-b34d-4b28c44ffb89","dtu-b47ac6eb-fad5-4180-951c-fe9d3427631f","itu-20c1ec55-f673-406d-8afc-38be5d5c2b1a","ruc-d00a6edc-ed72-4151-a5c3-fbacde800172","sdu-e6e554ae-4857-462e-a36f-a5000a8ad4bf"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities","Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-5-2EF4D44F2887D01DA306DF0BA9C2E28C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/undervisere-her-er-de-fem-stoerste-problemer-med-studentereva