{"abstract":"This issue of Valuation Studies presents an anthropological take on 'alternative valuations'. The three articles in this issue stem from a workshop held in August 2012 at James Cook University in Cairns, Australia. The workshop was organized by the guest editors of this issue along with Bruce Kapferer and the focus was on Values of dominance and difference.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Otto, Ton","Dalsgaard, Steffen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-253553"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"valuation studies 000000000004 000000000001 000000002016","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3384/vs.2001-5992.1641","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-253553","ids":["au-d9a05db8-dfe9-468c-b78e-adc4de6d363f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-5-6-6D5147AD59D8B407225A158A04B651E8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3384/vs.2001-5992.1641","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://valuationstudies.liu.se/Issues/contents/default.asp?DOI=10.3384/vs.2001-5992.1641","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Culture, Cognition and Computation, Department for","Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Department of Anthropology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ton","key":"ottoped","last":"Otto","locid":"90fe48d1-ca66-4f68-81e3-fd48f0fa67b6","name":"Otto, Ton","orcid":"0000-0002-5185-3017","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen","key":"dalsgaardped","last":"Dalsgaard","name":"Dalsgaard, Steffen","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3384/vs.2001-5992.1641","issn":["20015992"],"issue":"1","pages":"91","series":"Valuation studies","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-d9a05db8-dfe9-468c-b78e-adc4de6d363f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Valuation Studies 4(1) 2016","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-253553","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"The treatment of asylum seekers at the Manus Island Regional Processing Centre in Papua New Guinea (PNG) has attracted much international attention, but there has been little analysis of its local and transnational impact. This article investigates the repercussions for the communities on Manus Island, on domestic affairs in PNG, and on the relationship between PNG and Australia. Overall, it concludes that the costs arising from the money, manipulation and misunderstanding generated by the centre seem likely to outweigh the purported benefits, particularly for Manusians and other ordinary Papua New Guineans.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Wallis, Joanne","Dalsgaard, Steffen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381777"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Asylum seekers","Australia","International relations","Manus Province","Pacific Solution","Papua New Guinea","Refugees"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"money manipulation and misunderstanding on manus island","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/81299643/Wallis_and_Dalsgaard.FINAL.JPH.160905.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381777","identifier":[{"id":"84991260537","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-21c7cec3-d1a9-42a4-becd-0587b11cb2c9"],"keyword":["Australia","Manus Province","Pacific Solution","Papua New Guinea","asylum seekers","international relations","refugees"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-AA4AC1839BA03D0F8E76E4A93AD5A3D8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/81299643/Wallis_and_Dalsgaard.FINAL.JPH.160905.pdf","version